File: recording.tape
Output .gif out/recording.gif
Output .mp4 out/recording.mp4
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1500
Set Height 1150
Set TypingSpeed 15ms
Set WaitTimeout 240s
Hide 
Type cd <repo>/spikes/eng-860 && export OPENAI_API_KEY=$(cat ~/.hoop/secrets/openai.key) SIDECAR_HOST=$(sed -n 's/^LANE=//p' stack/.work/hosts) CALLER_TOKEN_FILE=stack/.secrets/caller-token START=$(date -u +%FT%TZ) PS1='$ ' && clear
Enter 1
Show 
Type # OpenAI-hosted sandbox, restricted to one host: a hoop sidecar http lane ($SIDECAR_HOST)
Enter 1
Type ./setup.sh
Enter 1
Wait Line ^\$ *$
Sleep 4s
Type clear; # the sidecar audit trail for this session
Enter 1
Type ./audit.sh $START
Enter 1
Sleep 6s
Type ./setup.sh --delete
Enter 1
Wait Line ^\$ *$
Sleep 2s
Creating out/recording.gif...
Creating out/recording.mp4...
Host your GIF on vhs.charm.sh: vhs publish <file>.gif
